T1  - Scaling the Strategy Wall: Efficient Jailbreaking of LLMs via Component-Based Multi-Objective Optimization
AU  - Tao, Jialing
AU  - Huang, Song
AU  - Zheng, Changyou
JO  - Computers, Materials and Continua
VL  - 88
